/** A validated bulk open: who is opening and the selected claim ids. */
== claim/BulkOpenRequest.java
/** Body of a bulk open: who is opening and the ids of the selected claims. */
== claim/BulkOpenResponse.java
/** How many of the selected claims were opened and how many were refused. */
